{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JER","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"耶利米書","commonName":"耶利米書","title":"耶利米書","order":24,"numberOfChapters":52,"sha256":"681b5a173916e28ae5f3b5c6bb5d16263b7d167f21a486ef3c62ed1ab29150f3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","lastChapterNumber":52,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/52.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1352},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列人背棄上帝"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"耶和華對我說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你去向耶路撒冷宣告，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『耶和華說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我記得你們年輕時對我的忠貞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愛我如新娘愛新郎，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跟隨我穿越曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"穿越不毛之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列是耶和華的聖民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是屬於祂的初熟果子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞吃它的必擔當罪責，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大禍臨頭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["雅各家啊，以色列家啊！你們要聽耶和華的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華說：",{"text":"「你們的祖先在我身上找到什麼過錯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他們遠離我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"去追隨虛妄的神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自己也變得虛妄呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們從不問，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『耶和華曾帶我們出埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"引導我們走過沙漠縱橫、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"深坑滿布、乾旱幽暗、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"杳無人跡的曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂如今在哪裡呢？』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我帶領你們進入肥沃之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"享受那裡的果子及豐富物產。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你們進來玷污我的土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我的產業成為可憎之地。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾祭司從來不問，『耶和華在哪裡？』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"傳授律法的不認識我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首領背叛我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"先知靠巴力說預言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隨從無用的偶像。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要指控你們和你們的子孫後代。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們去對岸的基提看看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"派人去基達仔細觀察一下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看有沒有這樣的事？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然列國的神明根本不是真神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻沒有一國更換自己的神明。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我的子民卻把自己榮耀的上帝換作了無用的偶像。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"諸天啊，要因此而震驚、戰慄、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大感淒涼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我的子民犯了兩項罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們離棄了我這活水源泉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為自己挖了不能蓄水的破池子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「以色列是奴隸嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是生來為奴的嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼他竟成了獵物呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敵人像獅子般向他咆哮吼叫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他的土地一片荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的城邑一片廢墟，杳無人煙。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪弗人和答比匿人打破了你的頭顱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你這不是自食其果嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你的上帝耶和華一路引導你的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你卻背棄祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在，你去埃及喝尼羅河的水有什麼好處呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你去亞述喝幼發拉底河的水有什麼好處呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必因自己的罪惡而受懲罰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因自己的背叛而受責備。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，你要省察且明白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背棄你的上帝耶和華、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不敬畏我，是多麼邪惡、痛苦的事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主——萬軍之耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"「很久以前，我折斷你的軛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"掙開你的捆索，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你卻拒絕事奉我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在各高崗上、綠樹下躺臥淫亂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你原本是我栽種的上等葡萄樹，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是上好的品種。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你怎麼自甘墮落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"變成了野葡萄？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"縱然你用鹼和許多肥皂清洗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你在我面前仍然罪跡斑斑。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"「你怎能說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我沒有玷污自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也沒有隨從巴力』？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看你在山谷中的行徑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"想想你的所作所為。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是一隻煩躁不安的母駱駝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"跑來跑去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是一隻習慣在曠野生活的野驢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求偶心切時便呼呼喘氣，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"發情時誰也控制不了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"公驢找你不費工夫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你發情的時候很容易找到你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說，『不要因追隨假神而跑破鞋子，喉嚨乾渴。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你卻說，『不行！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我愛外族的神明，一定要跟隨它們。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"text":"「以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們与你們的君王、官長、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭司和先知必蒙羞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如同被擒的盜賊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們認木頭為父，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"認石頭為生母。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不是面向我而是背對我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"危難時卻向我求救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們為自己造的神明在哪裡呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"危難時讓它們救你們吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「猶大人啊，你們神明的數目與你們的城邑一樣多！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"text":"「你們為什麼指控我呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們都背叛了我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我責打你們的兒女，卻是徒勞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們不受管教。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們殺害你們的先知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殘暴如獅子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這世代的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要留心聽耶和華的話。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對以色列人來說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道我是曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是幽暗之地嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為什麼我的子民竟說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『我們可以四處遊蕩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再追隨你』？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少女會忘記她的首飾嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新娘會忘記她的禮服嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民卻早已把我忘記，綿綿無期。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"text":"「你們真善於求愛啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至把技巧教給妓女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的衣服沾滿無辜窮人的血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們並沒有抓到他們進屋偷竊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖然這樣，你們還說，『我們是無辜的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華不再向我們發怒。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我必審判你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們拒不認罪。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們為什麼這樣忽東忽西地變來變去呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們投奔埃及必蒙羞辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像從前投奔亞述一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必抱愧蒙羞地離開埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華棄絕了你們的靠山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們從他們那裡必得不到幫助。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JER/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":37}